menu "sys_log"

    config SYS_LOG_LINE_MAX
        int "Captured log line (bytes)"
        default 160
        range 32 480
        help
          Log lines sent to the logs connector are cut to this. Formatted on
          the stack of the task that logs.

    config SYS_LOG_ERRORS_KEPT
        int "Error records kept for the app"
        default 16
        range 1 64
        help
          The latest error records (each up to SYS_LOG_RECORD_MAX bytes) are kept in RAM so the app can read what happened before
          it connected. A restart empties them.

endmenu
